Journey: Advocates - Week 1 Leader Video
Unit 1, Lesson 1: Apologetics

1
00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:12.190
In 1 Peter 3:15, Peter wrote this, But in your hearts set

2
00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:18.010
apart Christ as Lord. Always be prepared to give an answer to everyone

3
00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:21.890
who asks you, to give a reason for the hope that you have.

4
00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:25.190
But do this with gentleness and respect.

5
00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:30.950
Oftentimes when we're talking about things like apologetics, this verse is sort of

