00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:30.390
See, it's more than just saying, I have to give a defense.

33
00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:32.830
How are you going to give a defense?

34
00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:39.350
What do you know to be able to stand there and tell somebody what you believe and

